@Brbljator_HostAddress = http://localhost:5083

### Ispravna prijava (admin) – očekivano 200
POST {{Brbljator_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "korisnickoIme": "admin", "lozinka": "admin123" }

### Kriva lozinka – očekivano 401 + poruka
POST {{Brbljator_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "korisnickoIme": "admin", "lozinka": "kriva" }

### Prazan unos – očekivano 400
POST {{Brbljator_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "korisnickoIme": "", "lozinka": "" }

### Admin popis bez prijave – očekivano 401
GET {{Brbljator_HostAddress}}/api/admin/korisnici
